WEBVTT

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:05.170
Shishio was sent to Karasumori from
the Night Troops, the band of outcasts

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:08.230
within the Shadow Organization,
to assist the Kekkaishi.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.940
Though his complete transformation
was strictly forbidden,

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:15.140
he lost control during the battle
with the Kokuboro

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:17.170
and was one step away
from going berserk.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:20.580
Shishio had broken the taboo

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:24.190
but Yoshimori's brother Masamori,
Chief of the Night Troops,

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:28.320
decided he should continue his mission
with Yoshimori and Tokine.

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:35.730
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:37.600
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:42.800
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.700
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:48.140
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:52.550
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:52.710 --> 00:00:56.080
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:59.420
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:05.090
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.590
Sha la la la la...

00:01:10.930 --> 00:01:16.000
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.970
(Secret romance)

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:23.180
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:24.940
(A strange distance)

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:31.780
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:32.850
Yeah

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:36.320
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:39.990
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:45.260
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.050
Shishio.

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:11.790
Come out if you're in there!

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:13.560
I don't need any water purifiers.

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:20.530
Don't you have anything better to say?
Besides, you think I'm a salesman?

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:29.340
Damn it. My dad insisted on
giving you a homemade meal...

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:30.810
Leave it right there.

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:33.440
My share is in here, too!

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:47.350
What are you doing skipping school?

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:49.320
I was meditating.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:53.930
Meditating? Like putting
your mind in focus?

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:54.830
Yeah.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.060
What's in that box?

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:57.860
Oh?

00:02:58.040 --> 00:03:00.230
You've got sharp eyes.

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:08.140
Ta-da! My special chocolate cake,
the product of years of dedicated research!

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:13.380
Wh-What's with that?
I can hear you silently complaining!

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:16.660
You trying to say it's unmanly
for a guy to be making sweets?!

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:17.880
No...

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:19.020
Then what?!

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:21.650
I'll eat it.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:24.360
All right, then.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.040
You must have some opinion about it?

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.440
Gen! I know you're there!

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:40.940
Shishio. Seems like you have a visitor.

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:43.640
Huh? What's with that face?!

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.210
What's wrong? Are you okay?

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:48.890
N-Nothing...

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:53.550
You're obviously acting strange...
You want me to answer the door for you?

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.760
No! You must not open that door!

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:58.090
Huh?!

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:04.500
I don't need any water purifiers!

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:07.800
Is that something you say
with all your might?

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:09.800
Oh, I see...

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:13.580
Wh-Wha?

00:04:16.220 --> 00:04:17.240
I'm here.

00:04:18.890 --> 00:04:21.750
H-Hey, Shishio!
Who is she?

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.390
Hi there, Yoshimori-kun.

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.120
H-How do you know my name?

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:29.130
Thanks for being friends with my boy!

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:31.400
Your mom?

00:04:31.400 --> 00:04:32.390
No!

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:34.430
Um...

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.730
Tokine?! What are you doing here?

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:39.400
I don't know what's going on, but...

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:41.210
I brought her here.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:42.240
Huh?

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:45.180
I'm Hanashima Atora.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:49.310
Monster Tamer from the Night Troops
and Gen's instructor!

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:53.650
Oh, you're in the middle of a meal?
I'm so sorry.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.290
Why don't you apologize
for breaking the door first?

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:59.330
Wow! That cake looks delicious!

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:01.760
Oh that? I made it.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.460
What? You made it?
That's wonderful!

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.530
Did Gen eat this?

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:09.930
Huh? Yes.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.570
Oh...

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:14.470
Gen, I thought you hated sweet stuff.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:19.710
Really? You ate it without any complaint!
Why didn't you tell me?!

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:21.920
I-I felt bad about it...

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:24.440
Say it! I don't mind!

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:26.780
What? This feeling...

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:30.990
So you two are buddies now!

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:32.720
That's not it!

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:34.090
I see.

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:35.960
I'm so happy for you, Gen!

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:38.000
Get away from me!

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:42.470
Don't be shy.
We've bathed together in the past!

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:44.730
Shut up! Don't say things like that!

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:50.780
To tell you the truth,
I'm here to test you all.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:51.930
Test?!

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:55.580
That's right.
Gen almost got fired, right?

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:57.110
That's because...

00:05:57.390 --> 00:06:01.690
I really can't let that slide.

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:05.580
Don't just sit there.
Why don't you come over here?

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.120
Come here.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:12.860
Shishio obeyed her!

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:19.600
I'll personally scold you later.
But our topic today is teamwork.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:23.210
I'm guessing that you two
have some teamwork.

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:26.940
The problem is whether you can
maintain that when you add him in.

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:30.340
I want to see that for myself.

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:35.350
All right. If that's what you want.

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:39.080
Then let's do it tonight
at Karasumori Academy!

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:42.520
A test, huh...

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:46.600
Sounds good. Do what you want...

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:48.130
No, you're helping, too.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:51.370
So, Yoshi, what kind of girl is Atora?

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:54.040
Hmm... She's very bubbly and...

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:56.740
Hakubi, why are you
asking Yoshimori?

00:06:56.910 --> 00:07:00.350
Huh? No, I...
Oh, look! Gengen is here!

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:08.620
Look, he's already looking depressed.

00:07:09.060 --> 00:07:10.890
She probably gave him
a really good scolding.

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:13.350
Y-Yo, Shishio!

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:17.400
You were meditating today, right?
Let's get fired up!

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:23.000
Yeah, that meditation...
That all went to waste.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.060
SIGH...

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:27.570
Will we be able to work as a team?!

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:29.740
He's a completely different person.

00:07:33.880 --> 00:07:35.470
I'm here!

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.950
Okay, Raizo. Stop it right there.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.880
This is my monster partner Raizo.

00:07:44.090 --> 00:07:45.080
Please treat him well!

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:50.630
Gengen! Gengen!

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:52.460
It's okay. They're just playing.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:59.210
They're the best of friends in
the Shadow Organization, but...

00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:06.510
I should train him to stop
discharging electricity involuntarily...

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:08.350
What kind of friend is that?

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:12.120
Gengen. Sorry! Sorry!

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:16.990
I just want to confirm something.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:17.980
Yes?

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:21.030
You're only here to test us, right?

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:24.700
That means you're going back to
the Shadow Organization

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:25.790
after you're done, right?

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:27.690
Man!

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:30.370
I came all the way here
to see you and you're like that.

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:32.260
Raizo!

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:40.140
Hey!

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:43.050
That's only if you pass the test!

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:44.510
But...

00:08:45.090 --> 00:08:49.280
If you fail the test...
I'm taking you back with me, Gen.

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:50.790
What?!

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:52.380
You're going to take him?!

00:08:58.630 --> 00:09:00.290
You have only one objective.

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:04.800
Catch me within 30 minutes, unharmed.
Simple, don't you think?

00:09:06.240 --> 00:09:07.870
Just wait a minute!

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.940
And, begin!

00:09:11.050 --> 00:09:12.150
Atora-san!

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:13.140
Yes?

00:09:13.250 --> 00:09:15.150
Whatever the circumstances may be,
this is...

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:18.290
Oh, by the way, besides Raizo,

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:23.020
I brought a few more of my cute monsters
that will try to get in your way.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:26.120
They're wearing the same
bandana as me.

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:28.850
So don't confuse them
with Ayakashi and kill them!

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.490
Raizo!

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:36.100
That's not what I'm asking.
The test is...

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:37.470
One minute has elapsed!

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:41.900
You better hurry.
Thirty minutes can go by so fast.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:44.180
She disappeared.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:45.300
She's messing with us!

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:46.470
Hey!

00:09:46.610 --> 00:09:47.600
Gen-kun!

00:09:58.330 --> 00:09:59.420
Wait!

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:03.630
Gen! Stop!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:06.820
And, as you are...

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:07.930
Attention!

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:19.240
Sh-Shishio?
How did you end up like that?

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:24.580
Are you all right?

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:26.750
What were you thinking?

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:31.050
Don't you understand
what this test is for?

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:36.960
I'll make myself clear...
I'm serious here.

00:10:37.230 --> 00:10:39.130
S-Say, Atora-san...

00:10:39.130 --> 00:10:40.660
Five minutes have elapsed!

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:43.590
That's...

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:44.470
Why, you!

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:45.460
W-Wait!

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:55.910
I guess that was a thundercloud.

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:58.370
Honey!

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:07.950
A-Are you okay, honey?

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:14.900
Stay calm. Stay calm.
She's just trying to provoke us.

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:20.640
We have to get together
and come up with a plan!

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:23.640
Why didn't you tell me about
that attack with the cloud?!

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:25.580
I told you to wait, didn't I?

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:26.250
Yoshimori!

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:27.180
You're too late!

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:28.550
You slowpoke!

00:11:28.550 --> 00:11:31.350
Don't call me that!
You also tried to-

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:33.180
You idiots!

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:38.120
Strategy meeting.
Come with me!

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:45.320
Since Gen-kun knows Atora-san best,

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:49.890
can you explain to us
how she fights?

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:56.170
You should cooperate with us.
Can't you trust us?

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:57.640
Yoshimori.

00:11:58.110 --> 00:11:59.100
Hmph.

00:11:59.250 --> 00:12:05.340
Tell us anything. We need a strategy
but I need a place to start.

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:08.020
Hanashima Atora is...

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:09.020
Oh?

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:13.930
She's agile, but her fighting abilities
don't amount to much.

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:16.960
The most she can do is
bust down an apartment door...

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:18.700
That's still pretty amazing...

00:12:18.970 --> 00:12:20.800
The biggest problem is her monsters.

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:24.760
The one that we have to
be most careful of is him...

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:26.600
...Raizo.

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:29.370
We have to do something
about that thundercloud.

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:31.800
Those things are a part of Raizo.

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:34.110
Unless we take out Raizo,
they won't disappear.

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:35.840
I see...

00:12:35.950 --> 00:12:39.040
That's pretty much all I know.
At this point...

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:43.780
Thank you Gen-kun. Keep talking to us.
Your information is very useful!

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:48.190
See? There is plenty of stuff
we won't know unless you tell us.

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:53.590
All right! Before Atora-san,
we have to take out Raizo!

00:12:54.270 --> 00:12:58.000
Gen-kun, you'll attack.
Yoshimori and I will back you up.

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:02.370
I want to give him the central position
until he gets used to this.

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.780
Do both of you understand?

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:07.270
Wait.

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:11.010
You do the attacking.

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:27.320
Ketsu!

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:31.300
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:39.840
It's not over yet!
Ketsu!

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:42.670
I got him!

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:06.440
Shake him up and I'll find
an opportunity to attack.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:09.710
But that alone
probably won't be enough.

00:14:10.580 --> 00:14:14.450
But he's simpleminded.
Once he gets mad...

00:14:17.650 --> 00:14:19.640
...he'll definitely charge at me.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:21.650
That's when you...

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:23.450
...go all out and...

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:25.950
...hit him straight on!

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:27.720
Ketsu!

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:32.750
Atora.

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:35.500
Oh, Majiro. You're finally awake?

00:14:35.870 --> 00:14:37.530
Raizo got taken out.

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:45.610
They're not bad.
But we're just getting started!

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:47.910
Only eight minutes left.

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:49.580
Majiro!

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:50.640
Gotcha!

00:14:57.520 --> 00:15:01.650
Now let me see
the teamwork you three have.

00:15:03.200 --> 00:15:05.560
Hey! Isn't flying cheating?

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:08.830
She's flying with the help of
a monster called Majiro.

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:11.400
He acts as Atora's wings and radar.

00:15:11.870 --> 00:15:15.900
He has a sensor that can
detect approaching enemies.

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:18.750
That's the worst kind of power
to have in a game of tag.

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.010
This is bad... We have less than
seven minutes left!

00:15:21.280 --> 00:15:23.910
Seven minutes?!
We don't have time to set up a trap.

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:25.810
We might just have to
do an aerial battle...

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:29.350
But still... she can read
all of our attacks, right?

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:30.650
Yeah.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:31.980
Tokine.

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:35.060
We'll have to rely on
Gen-kun's speed here.

00:15:35.600 --> 00:15:39.030
We'll make Kekkai to assist
his movements in the air.

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:43.100
Gen-kun, you'll use those Kekkai
as footing, get close to Atora-san...

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:45.470
Gen-kun?

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:47.610
Hey!
What's the matter with you?

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:49.570
Is there a problem?

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:50.970
N-No...

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:53.770
Then what? Tell us
what's on your mind.

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:54.980
Yeah.

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:55.970
Say it.

00:15:58.620 --> 00:15:59.920
T-To tell you the truth...

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:07.750
She has been training me
since I was young...

00:16:08.160 --> 00:16:10.260
Disobedient children
will be punished!

00:16:10.260 --> 00:16:13.030
Forgive me!

00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:15.430
I can't disobey her commands.

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:17.740
That's why he's so nervous.

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:19.260
She's a monster tamer after all.

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:22.810
But I'll be all right! I can do this
with my will power!

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:26.540
You just have to make sure you
don't hear her voice right?

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:28.670
Here you go.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:30.980
What's this?

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:33.380
Tissue paper.
Stuff it into your ears.

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:35.560
That's so primitive.

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:36.780
Shut up!

00:16:37.090 --> 00:16:39.490
But I won't be able to
hear your voices either.

00:16:39.990 --> 00:16:43.450
That's why you have to trust us, Shishio.

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:51.900
Don't lose sight of my movements!

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:55.630
They're not coming.
Majiro, let's lower the altitude a little.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:00.910
Here they come.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:02.380
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:04.750
- Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!
- You can't win just by using force!

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:21.440
What?!

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:22.460
Only two minutes left.

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:25.890
Ketsu!

00:17:46.630 --> 00:17:48.720
Gen is speeding up.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:50.620
That's nothing!

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:54.260
Gen! Slow down!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.500
Oh? It's not working?!

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:59.230
Why? Is he using ear plugs?

00:18:02.710 --> 00:18:03.700
Ketsu!

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:08.870
Ketsu!

00:18:09.920 --> 00:18:10.580
Impossible!

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.550
Do they trust each other so much,

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:14.110
that they can do this
without communicating?!

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:17.110
Can I do this?

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:18.310
Ketsu!

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:28.830
She did that just now
by predicting Gen's reflexes...

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:31.130
Tokine-chan is good! But!

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:32.870
You need to watch your step!

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:36.810
Tokine!

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:37.800
What?!

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:39.340
Only twenty seconds left!

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:44.250
Damn! What do I do?
What should I do?!

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:06.330
Shishio?!

00:19:10.510 --> 00:19:11.570
This is it.

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.940
Atora! This is bad!

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:18.440
You're kidding!

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:21.520
You're not getting away!

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:24.090
Go!

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:25.430
All right!

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:26.410
Uh oh!

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:29.520
Ketsu!

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:34.030
All right!

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:35.830
I got...

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:38.330
...you!!

00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:45.300
Wh-What?!

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:52.940
Yoshimori!

00:19:55.320 --> 00:19:57.760
No way.

00:19:57.860 --> 00:19:59.660
Looks like you're out of time.

00:20:00.560 --> 00:20:01.590
That's...

00:20:08.240 --> 00:20:14.440
Damn it! Damn it!

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:21.550
I'm sorry... It's all my fault...

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.140
It's not your fault.

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:24.870
But...

00:20:25.220 --> 00:20:27.210
We did everything we could.

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:29.080
It's upsetting but...

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:33.820
Why are you all so depressed?
You guys won.

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:34.790
Huh?

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:38.360
You did manage to catch me.

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:41.030
Only a small part of me though!

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:44.300
Th-Then!

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:46.470
Yup. You all pass.

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:49.440
All right!

00:20:54.950 --> 00:20:58.710
Looks like we didn't
play any part in this.

00:20:59.050 --> 00:21:01.150
I think that's fine once in a while.

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:03.860
We did it, Shishio!
We turned it around at the last minute!

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:05.590
You did it! You did it!

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:06.390
Huh?!

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:07.690
Gengen!

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:10.050
Hey...

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:13.090
Are you sure you want to
consider this our win?

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.690
What? Are you not satisfied?

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:16.770
It's not that...

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:19.100
You don't understand?

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:24.080
That stubborn and clumsy Gen
finally started trusting his friends

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:27.770
and entrusted everything to
Yoshimori at the very end.

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:30.340
That's enough for me
to consider this a pass.

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:32.250
I need to thank both of you...

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:33.910
Atora-san...

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:38.560
Gengen! Let's go home!
Together! Let's go home!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:41.760
No. I'm not going home yet...

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:44.630
Why? Why?
Gengen.

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:48.330
You have other attack monsters.

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:54.440
Yeah. But... I didn't come here
to hurt you guys.

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:57.630
Bye, Gen...

00:21:59.110 --> 00:22:01.210
Take good care of your friends...

00:22:03.050 --> 00:22:04.110
Let's go, Raizo!

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:12.960
Take care everyone! Gen, we should
take a bath together again someday!

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:15.060
What the heck are you talking about?!

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:16.090
Bye!

00:22:17.830 --> 00:22:20.070
You're still bathing together?

00:22:20.070 --> 00:22:22.430
Please let me join you when you do.

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:23.730
Sh-Shut up!

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:25.310
So you are!

00:22:25.310 --> 00:22:27.410
Tell me all about it when you do.

00:22:27.410 --> 00:22:28.640
Sh-Shut up!

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:30.630
You guys...

00:22:46.060 --> 00:22:51.590
10 minute break,
I wanna do so much

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:59.500
Class is over, but someone
in the front asks a question

00:22:59.870 --> 00:23:02.030
"What nerve"

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:05.410
I'm at ease as long as
I have a mirror

00:23:05.450 --> 00:23:09.140
"Make up's on right,
my eyes look all right"

00:23:09.180 --> 00:23:15.520
See, if you look behind you,
there's a girl who curled her hair

00:23:15.860 --> 00:23:20.560
I hate studying,
I like P.E. Okay

00:23:20.590 --> 00:23:22.490
Basketball, volleyball,
and tennis, what?

00:23:22.530 --> 00:23:27.760
You're not gonna make me
run long distance today, teacher!

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:31.290
My face will get oily,
and I hate being sore

00:23:31.340 --> 00:23:35.400
I'm that kind of
a beautiful high school girl

00:23:49.890 --> 00:24:00.230
10 minute break, I'll get busy
drawing a map of the future
